Subject: CPMS I02A Raw String Delimiter Fault

& [Detection] focused feature test compilation rejected a one-hash raw string because the JSON Pointer contains the terminating sequence quote-hash
& [Impact] test source did not compile; no library output, runtime behavior, schema document, or external state was produced
& [Repair] use a two-hash raw string delimiter for the two exact local-reference assertions
& [Prevention] select a raw-string delimiter not present in embedded JSON Pointer text before running the focused gate
& [Disposition] repaired_before_first_test_execution

